          "bbox": [
            0.302,
            0.594,
            0.883,
            0.652
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) Your father bought a saucepan made of two different materials, A and B, as shown in Fig. 7.14. The materials A and B have the following properties —"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
