          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.336,
            0.677,
            0.784,
            0.696
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(b) Both A and B are poor conductors of heat"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.338,
            0.697,
            0.883,
            0.734
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(c) A is a good conductor and B is a poor conductor of heat"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.337,
            0.736,
            0.883,
            0.773
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(d) A is a poor conductor and B is a good conductor of heat"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.297,
            0.775,
            0.883,
            0.833
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) Pins are stuck to a metal strip with wax and a burning candle is kept below the rod, as shown in Fig. 7.15. Which of the following will happen?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 24,
